# __NAME__

Game server scaffolded from [moke-kit](https://github.com/GStones/moke-kit).

## Run

```bash
# Redis / Mongo / NATS
docker compose -f ./deployment/docker-compose/infrastructure.yaml up -d

# service (gRPC+HTTP :8081, TCP :8888)
go run ./cmd/__NAME__/service/main.go
```

Smoke test:

```bash
curl -s -X POST localhost:8081/v1/hello/hi \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"uid":"10000","message":"hello","topic":"__NAME__"}'
```

Interactive client:

```bash
go run ./cmd/__NAME__/client/main.go grpc
```

